        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月六日，谢尔顿在巴黎击败保罗。蒂亚福终于锁定资格，第一次走进都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cb6988858d41ebdb21e6615de316a701f521981f60432b10a25d2d3509e55b3f",
      "words_sha256": "7c7c9076f5920f63ee937e859b5266f187930ae15c0062d098acc355e5ff2c0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:19eff4eb21b02ac8658b221c28482648040190a6115603cc42c5b6cd2647421e",
      "request_id": "19eff4eb21b02ac8658b221c28482648040190a6115603cc42c5b6cd2647421e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dc87a369335241a899a0bd6e368d3ee0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二月阿卡普尔科，他打到决赛，两盘输给科博利，收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5bb9c7d7b3f93a616559a17446c2c53ead5ec0e986b1bb2c3142e5045132c113",
      "words_sha256": "2825303a379f8beefef4809804f4bc9fe305fb21cde73705ac60671386c7dfd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:234529500afa108af9137adc902e6f0c5a6a360072f95efe33e82f799b7854c0",
      "request_id": "234529500afa108af9137adc902e6f0c5a6a360072f95efe33e82f799b7854c0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cde0c8383a8dc9d85615745158147f4f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先回到澳网。第三轮对德米纳尔，他三盘落败。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "858890ec56b4681e0b18c627f547d706e8b85c074120658113dd01b3790aeb15",
      "words_sha256": "58eca1d0ee6f5bd122208e2bd547964d0be75cd0796ec300e7efc23652034535"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:395511ec71419a95a9cd1329718e7f2cc21f167a159baa4ad2ef1c9bcff2095b",
      "request_id": "395511ec71419a95a9cd1329718e7f2cc21f167a159baa4ad2ef1c9bcff2095b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20fe300a6706d96c98388b554bf4644b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "带着哈雷冠军来到温网，他在第三轮五盘输给布勃利克。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cc0c72a3522b302b8d5b954da4d19f947c673f7aca7a41731abfb31f8bbab333",
      "words_sha256": "9cd6de386e88e0faf33ac296afb29af9a83a44cdc478a3f8307b89eb38345e64"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3bcfc834c43f403ab3289c2ef2a378286fdc01bc336e84a3321b32b9c6ee3482",
      "request_id": "3bcfc834c43f403ab3289c2ef2a378286fdc01bc336e84a3321b32b9c6ee3482",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "64256650cd9ea9663757ff7fac22108c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月七日，蒂亚福三千三百九十分，排名赛季积分榜第八。高亮的八位球员，都已锁定年终资格。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8155a193b8a65df8a50226131db3dbe4167cc23df119ed05b64ec1d9a23fe1b6",
      "words_sha256": "155ba9212630e03699137badd333ef0515d6f2ed9c9a6e5a21a0e09597198877"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5146ee03f7b259278d02a2950b0118f950ad25bab343bd5c1a6b8232a3b5a215",
      "request_id": "5146ee03f7b259278d02a2950b0118f950ad25bab343bd5c1a6b8232a3b5a215",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0b4a4693dd541ade196c3b47e0dfa30e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "对菲斯，他扳回第二盘，决胜盘却一局未得。第二次打进大师赛决赛，还是收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c771d771e2b89caf26bbb35cac1483ab0c84f4f8566b77e246ecb253f710ff42",
      "words_sha256": "aea8be58958069c0ce70543b49d52146092bd545d6b6cf79a3ee28c2674ad85e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5cc5cf5a105d06851fb76b7b0de7cc45b499064cc50254eb8be57d4918d8654c",
      "request_id": "5cc5cf5a105d06851fb76b7b0de7cc45b499064cc50254eb8be57d4918d8654c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b59ecae0f4397004970b5aa243b0b822",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次到都灵，你看好蒂亚福拿到几场胜利？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e5611efd9403156f6112eae31f0615ca759474940f7f77b08367be099dccae62",
      "words_sha256": "e3f60834221be9684e13782009d19eb536c234067572db569e252d268a23d92a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:681297c07b5220e06dcad0192c646e45c72a0c8688e2b9266e8c7d80b4e0ce09",
      "request_id": "681297c07b5220e06dcad0192c646e45c72a0c8688e2b9266e8c7d80b4e0ce09",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ff6af01a92bfa5718ad90c2cbf6d5a68",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月，在蒙特利尔因伤退赛。右手接受手术后，他又在辛辛那提闯进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f25122f7f1aac9c463dad4258ff96b5460181bab906082b764943f9170397e58",
      "words_sha256": "037d7aab93eba139861dfe3dbd92785e0e1f9e45259876226b15a7331154a620"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:696424f375c867606e0df45d9c49f8047d66ce2507c917d6b09573a23d6c8552",
      "request_id": "696424f375c867606e0df45d9c49f8047d66ce2507c917d6b09573a23d6c8552",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1eaa0d22a148d2a2543320649a7e75e0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网四分之一决赛，先丢两盘，第三盘又一度零比三。他最后连赢三盘，逆转米切尔森。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2fd620394f441a010bb9e3bc1413fbe91d3daeb7a201601a57c31b0cff5383e2",
      "words_sha256": "048bdf94a1bc613477bf7a75c19e77754ffe7f67bd341bf16ae66465933d7253"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:718184054c0df648bee537137bd82fcd03b675cba06d6613a58c36287d85b66c",
      "request_id": "718184054c0df648bee537137bd82fcd03b675cba06d6613a58c36287d85b66c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fce2d29eba4ddc157d32725cd434f2bf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "法网第四轮，打了五小时二十六分。他曾盘分二比一领先，第四盘也领先四比一，最后却被阿尔纳尔迪逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "edd8668baea1a5e46051a86756e097b48567e95f2336b17c70c21d78e94ccc38",
      "words_sha256": "fdcfefda94880ee32959816b36861a23e3f2cd8979d622e1bd869f81c2ddba43"
    },
    {
