        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网半决赛，谢尔顿挡住了蒂亚福。到了十一月，又是谢尔顿，替他锁定了第一张都灵门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "91c0829f1469c4a0dc0cba2b64382277f144f0d39787584fa307226f62e20b29",
      "words_sha256": "247171169427e3796ce0e3add2cc5b39313062817820de7b2867c891e45cdb8b"
    },
    {
